+// block, instead of only at their top vertices. Wynncraft's two-block-tall crops
+// are two stacked quads in one model (y -1..15 and 15..31); with a per-quad
+// top/bottom flag the shared edge at y = 15 opened up as they swayed. Vanilla
+// plants span y 0..16, where both give the same result.
 vec3 animate_vertex(
     vec3 world_pos,
